# Only the C# gameplay scripts are tracked in this repo - everything else
# (Unity's generated caches, imported/third-party art assets, scenes and
# prefabs, build output) is excluded so the repo stays source code only.
# docs/ is kept as an exception for gameplay captures the README may embed,
# since those have to live in the repo for GitHub to render them.

# Ignore everything at the root by default...
/*

# ...except the things we actually want to track.
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/docs/
!/Assets/
/Assets/*
!/Assets/Scripts/
